From fca99f4185d5b65e32f58f4871279655314005e4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bringup <bringup@local>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 13:50:12 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 03/38] kebab: add bring-up diagnostics (protocol probes,
 USBCFG candidates)

Diagnostics only, no functional change:
- PcdDebugPrintErrorLevel = EFI_D_ERROR so vendor driver errors surface
- [DIAG] protocol presence counters (USB2_HC/USB_IO/BLOCK_IO/SIMPLE_FS/PCI_IO/QSEECOM/USBFN_IO)
- [DBG] UsbfnDwc3Dxe depex prerequisite probe (16 GUIDs)
- [USBCFG] candidate GUID probe

Verified on device: baseline still boots, Boot Manager reachable.
---
 Platforms/OnePlus/kebabPkg/kebab.dsc          |   5 +
 .../Drivers/RamManagerDxe/RamManager.c        | 169 +++++++++++++++++-
 .../Drivers/RamManagerDxe/RamManagerDxe.inf   |  10 ++
 3 files changed, 183 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

